      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "So the point is simple: train a smaller model against real business judgment, prove it can carry more of the work, and lower the cost of every decision.\nThe right model for the right work.\n",
      "demo_actions": "Close on the full loop: reward function, training scenarios, and evaluation results. Summarize RFT in Foundry as a way to move work from a larger expensive model to a smaller cheaper one, while holding onto acceptable decision quality.",
